service('custom-web-application-development','Custom web applications','Software shaped around the way your business actually works.','code','Workflow automation|Custom dashboards|User roles and permissions|Database design|Responsive interfaces','Spreadsheets, disconnected tools and repeated data entry can make simple operations difficult to manage.','We map the workflow first, define the people and decisions involved, and build a focused application around those requirements. You get a system designed for your operations, with a clear path for future improvements.')
service('laravel-development','Laravel development','A dependable backend for your next big idea.','terminal','Laravel and PHP|MySQL architecture|Authentication and authorization|Queues and Redis|Testing and deployment','A growing application needs more than a collection of features. It needs clear business rules, reliable data and code that can be maintained.','We build Laravel applications with explicit validation, scoped permissions and a structured data model. Background work goes into queues, and important workflows are tested before deployment.')
service('saas-development','SaaS & multi-tenant platforms','Turn your product idea into a platform built to grow.','layers','Multi-tenant architecture|Subscription billing|Tenant administration|Onboarding flows|Payment integration','A SaaS product must serve different organizations without mixing their data or making every customer a separate maintenance project.','We define the tenant boundary, access rules and subscription model early. I build the core product around a focused first release, with tenant-aware operations and a plan for onboarding, monitoring and growth.')
service('crm-development','CRM development','Keep your leads, customers and next steps connected.','grid','Lead management|Customer records|Sales pipeline|Follow-ups and tasks|Activity history|Notifications','When lead information lives in separate spreadsheets and conversations, follow-ups are easy to miss and sales activity is difficult to understand.','We bring customer records, ownership and next actions into one workflow. The pipeline reflects your sales process, so the team can see what needs attention without assembling information from multiple tools.')
service('hrms-development','HRMS & payroll systems','Make people operations clearer, from attendance to payroll.','grid','Employee management|Biometric attendance|Leave and comp off|Shifts and timesheets|Payroll and salary templates|Payslips|Policies and notifications','Attendance exceptions, changing shifts and different leave policies make payroll preparation time-consuming and difficult to verify.','We document policy rules and exception handling before development. Attendance, leave and payroll are connected through reviewable steps, with access controls for employee and salary information.')
service('erp-development','ERP development','Connect the operations that keep your business moving.','layers','Operational dashboards|Connected departments|Purchasing and orders|Approval workflows|Reporting|Roles and permissions','Separate departmental tools can create duplicate records and conflicting versions of the same business information.','We plan shared entities and ownership with your team, then connect modules incrementally. Explicit approval steps and traceable records help departments work from the same information.')
service('healthcare-management-system-development','Healthcare management systems','Connect patient enquiries with everyday healthcare operations.','shield','Patients and appointments|Enquiries|Billing and invoices|Expenses|Staff and services|Role-based permissions','A public website may collect enquiries while the operations team handles appointments, billing and staff in disconnected tools.','We connect enquiry capture with a purpose-built administration platform. Patient information and operational functions receive scoped permissions, and workflows are designed around the staff who use them.')
service('inventory-management-system-development','Inventory management systems','Know what is in stock, where it is and what happens next.','grid','Products and stock|Warehouses|Purchase and sales orders|Barcode management|Stock transfers|Stock movement history','Manual stock updates can leave teams with conflicting counts and little visibility into how inventory changed.','We define the stock movement model and validation rules first. Receiving, dispatch and transfers update inventory through recorded transactions so teams can trace adjustments and investigate differences.')
service('warehouse-management-system-development','Warehouse management systems','Bring structure to every movement through your warehouse.','layers','Inbound and putaway|Storage and retrieval|Inventory tracking|Cycle counting|Barcode integration|ERP and TMS integration','Warehouse teams need a consistent view of what arrived, where it was stored and what is ready to leave.','We build workflows around warehouse locations and inventory movements. Barcode-led steps, cycle counts and integration checkpoints help teams identify exceptions before they spread across connected systems.')
service('api-development-integration','API development & integration','Make your applications work better together.','link','REST APIs|Payment gateways|AWS S3 integration|Third-party services|Webhooks|Integration monitoring','Systems that cannot exchange information often leave your team copying records and resolving avoidable mismatches.','We design validated APIs and integration flows with clear authentication, failure handling and retry behavior. External responses are checked, and repeated events are handled carefully to avoid duplicate operations.')
service('laravel-maintenance','Maintenance & improvements','A practical way forward for the application you already have.','shield','Bug investigation and fixing|Feature improvements|Performance review|Dependency maintenance|Deployment support|Codebase review','An existing Laravel application can accumulate bugs, slow workflows or features that no longer fit the business.','We start by reproducing the issue and understanding the affected workflow. Changes stay focused, with regression checks and a deployment plan that accounts for the current application and its users.')
service('admin-panel-development','Admin panel development','Give your team the controls they need to run the business.','grid','Operational dashboards|User management|Role and permission management|Search and filters|Approval screens|Exports','Teams need safe, efficient ways to manage application data without relying on a developer for everyday changes.','We build admin interfaces around real tasks, with clear validation, permission checks and useful status information. Sensitive changes receive appropriate safeguards and deliberate review steps.')

